      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report a case of pneumocephalus, as a complication of diverticulitis, in a 48-year-old man who presented with back pain and mild disorientation. There are no previous reports of diverticulitis causing this phenomenon."},
